  "title": "Eve’s Chicken Quarters",
  "description": "Chicken leg quarters baked with rice in a creamy broccoli mixture. I dislike most convenience food recipes, but I feel that this one’s a winner, as it’s not only fast but healthy too!",
  "authors": [
